      "writtenOn": "2024-11-13T21:22:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think you could deal with this using something like:\n\n```\nmDescriptorAllocatorsPendingDeallocation.Use([\u0026](auto pendings) {\n    for (Ref\u003cDescriptorSetAllocator\u003e\u0026 allocator :\n        pendings-\u003eIterateUpTo(kMaxExecutionSerial)) {\n        allocator-\u003eFinishDeallocation(kMaxExecutionSerial);\n    }\n\n    // Releasing the uploader enqueues buffers to be released.\n    // Call Tick() again to clear them before releasing the deleter.\n    GetResourceMemoryAllocator()-\u003eTick(kMaxExecutionSerial);\n    pendings-\u003eClearUpTo(kMaxExecutionSerial);\n});\n```\n\nto avoid introduing `TakeUpTo` and making a copy of the data.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 914,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 922,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "bda9230588a18c13f04310b4d66aae938e8d65b7",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
