      "writtenOn": "2024-11-14T14:53:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e IDK that the Tick calls need to be interleaved.\n\nIt looks like `FencedDeleter::Tick()` will release all kinds of resources, including VkDescriptorPools, and then `mDescriptorAllocatorsPendingDeallocation-\u003eClearUpTo()` will enqueue more VkDescriptorPools for deletion next time FencedDeleter::Tick() runs. That order looked intentional enough I didn\u0027t want to change it and my Vulkan understanding isn\u0027t good enough to know if there is a reason the VkDescriptorPools have to be deleted later? If this order should be changed I can do that as a separate CL just let me kniow!",
      "parentUuid": "e600a0e5_2b81fd91",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 914,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 922,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "bda9230588a18c13f04310b4d66aae938e8d65b7",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
